Package: statGLM
Title: Statistical General Linear Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Antigravity", "Team", email = "developer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Clean-room implementation of general linear models, estimable
    functions, Type I, II, and III sums of squares, least squares means
    (marginal means), custom linear contrasts, and multivariate analysis of
    variance.
